ground elements are slightly out of focus, enhancing the spatial depth effect. The artistic style is a combination of highly realistic photography texture and dreamy color rendering, using the visual expression technique of \"realistic\" and \"celulu\". The skin texture and clothing folds are clear and realistic, but at the same time, a large number of decorative glitter points and softened halos are introduced to create a magical atmosphere; Accurate depth control - the character's face is sharp and prominent, while the background is completely blurred into a warm golden blurred area. The camera angle is a close up shooting angle that is inclined upwards and slightly to the right."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 104, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 79, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.20.1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["FLUX 引导50"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 137.75123596191406], "pos": [2345.54931640625, 2821.3662109375], "id": 82, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [235.08973693847656, 1978.6630859375], "widgets_values": ["一位年轻东方女性特写肖像，在梦幻般的暖光氛围中呈现古典华美气质；她拥有白皙细腻的皮肤、乌黑浓密卷发盘成精致高髻，并以紫色花朵簇拥装饰及透明绿色蝴蝶形发簪点缀，额前与脸颊散布淡彩珠光和金色碎屑。身穿轻薄透纱质感粉色汉服或古风长裙，衣料上绣有蓝绿云纹、花枝图案并勾勒金线，在阳光下泛着柔美反光；领口内衬为浅蓝色细节可见。她呈半身侧向镜头凝视姿态，头部微仰略偏右方，眼神专注而带忧思。背景是温暖黄色阳光穿透树叶形成的斑驳光影与大量金色闪光粒子散布其中，并夹杂淡蓝天空一角